{%- comment -%}
  The hero's play button (the landing's: a big frosted-glass disc with a ring breathing out of it), over the hero's
  picture: the hero itself is the film's idle state, and a click anywhere on it plays the film (assets/bizmis-film.js).
  Params: label, duration (read out, e.g. "2:48").
{%- endcomment -%}
<button type="button" class="hero-film-play" data-film-open aria-label="{{ label | escape }} ({{ duration }})">
  <span class="hero-film-play__disc" data-play aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="hero-film-play__ring"></span>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3"/></svg>
  </span>
</button>
